Other implementation details are as follows. We computed the latent-space likelihood gradients in \eqref{eq:Jd_estimate} using reverse-mode automatic differentiation through both the likelihood $\pi_{\mathrm{like}}$ and the decoder. 
We estimated the matrix in the change-of-variables formula 
in \eqref{eq:cov_formula} 
using $N_s = 4{,}000$ samples and 
computed the Jacobians $\nabla_{\bsz} \phi^d(\bsz)$ using forward-mode automatic differentiation.
