\suppnote{Prediction-level comparison of ejection-fraction estimates}
{si-note:ef-prediction}
Supplementary Fig.~\ref{si-fig:ef-scatter-comparison} compares predicted
and reference ejection fraction (EF) for the held-out TCH-EF test set.
The shared axes reveal differences in prediction spread and compression
across the reference EF range. EchoDino with uniform sampling achieved
an MAE of 6.41 EF percentage points, which decreased to 5.65 with MEMS,
compared with 9.11 for EchoPrime, 7.40 for PanEcho, and 7.71 for DINOv3.
